# stage1_proximity.param — Stage 1 (ArduPilot leg, synthetic data).
# Just gets our LaserScan onto ArduPilot's proximity so PRX shows in the
# dataflash log and Mission Planner's proximity radar (Gates 1A/1B/1C).
# The FC does NOT act on it yet — that is Stage 2.
#
# Load (MAVProxy):  param load stage1_proximity.param
#        (mavros):  ros2 run mavros mavparam load stage1_proximity.param
# REBOOT the FC after loading — PRX1_TYPE takes effect on reboot.
PRX1_TYPE        2
# PRX1_YAW_CORR intentionally omitted: the yaw-correction param name is
# version-specific (PRX1_YAWCORR on some builds) and MAVProxy rejects an
# unknown name. It defaults to 0 = no correction, which is what we want since
# we send body-frame. Gate 1C verifies this empirically.
